# resid-test: test02 — Change sustain level
# Source: https://github.com/libsidplayfp/resid-test/blob/master/tests/test02
# AD=0x00 (fastest attack+decay), SR=0x84 (Sustain=8, Release=4)
# Tests: lower sustain during sustain triggers decay, raise sustain does NOT raise env.

reset

write, 0x13, 0x00
run, 3
write, 0x14, 0x84
run, 3

# Gate ON
write, 0x12, 0x01
run, 5000

# Decrease sustain from 8→4
write, 0x14, 0x44
run, 5000

# Increase sustain from 4→6 (envelope should NOT increase — stays <= 0x44)
write, 0x14, 0x64
run, 2000

end
